Throttle FIFO games instead of queueing their frames (gmstream; gm_throttle, on by default).

Not for a game under Steam's frame limiter (GAMESCOPE_FPS_LIMIT): the limiter
paces it already, a finished frame waiting for the limiter's refresh read as a
backlog here, and the skipped releases took a 60 fps limit on a 120 Hz output
to 40-45 fps (62 with the throttle off; Witcher 3, 2026-11-07).

